User: I'm watching from New York, Eastern Time.
Agent Action: Call Tool get_race_schedule with args {'user_timezone': 'America/New_York', 'race_query': 'next'}
Agent: According to the latest-available 2026 data, qualifying for the Bahrain Grand Prix starts at 4 AM Eastern Time on Saturday, October 3rd. The race itself will be on Sunday at 3 AM Eastern Time. Would you like to know the practice session times or the weather forecast for the weekend?
User: That's perfect, thank you for the information! That is all I needed to know.
Agent Action: Call Tool end_session with args {'reason': 'The user confirmed they have all the information they needed and thanked the agent.', 'session_escalated': False}

